AtlanticOS: preserve Mach task lifecycle and VM information while gating optional BSD callbacks.
No AMFI opt-out is granted without MACF. No init-process identity is fabricated.
Watchport, deferred-reclaim and memorystatus code follows its actual feature selection.

diff --git a/osfmk/kern/task.c b/osfmk/kern/task.c
--- a/osfmk/kern/task.c
+++ b/osfmk/kern/task.c
@@ -204,6 +204,10 @@
